<h1>Abbey Meachum</h1>
  <!--Introduction paragraph-->
  <P>My name is Abbey Christin Meachum, and I am 19 years old. I was born in Rockingham, North Carolina, but lived my entire life in Wadesboro, North Carolina. Growing up, I had the privilege of having caring and loving family members, including my mother Marcia, my father Barry, and my brother Noah. Growing up with such a loving home has shaped me into the person I am today.<br> My family has always pushed me to strive for greatness; hence, I decided to continue my education after high school and attend community college. </P>
  <hr>
  <P>Graduating from community college is a big step in achieving my future educational and career goals. I am currently majoring in Information Systems; I chose this major because I am interested in careers in technology and would like to pursue one in the future. After I graduate, I plan to transfer to a university to continue learning information systems and earn my bachelor's degree. With hard work and determination, I know I can be successful in my education and use that knowledge to build a thriving career in the future. </P>
